      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "作为团队的负责人，一路走到了今天。\n每一位赛马娘都拥有稀有的天赋。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbb7bd44e61f6c4051a1794757dac0b2f2b5400ca4d1a30f60a9cc766a9579c4",
